  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'One grid for the whole country, run from the National Control Centre.
    The new machines are enormous and slow: reactors run flat out on BASE and can''t
    follow the load, coal takes hours to start, and only the gas turbines are quick.
    Keep enough on the bars for the evening peak, and not so much that the night
    can''t take it.'
